sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Owner (already registered)
    participant TG as Telegram bot
    participant Core as core + storage
    participant VK as VK bot

    U->>TG: /link
    TG->>Core: create link_code (8 chars, TTL 10 min, one-time)
    Core-->>TG: K3F9A2B7
    TG-->>U: "Send to the VK bot: /link K3F9A2B7"
    U->>VK: /link K3F9A2B7
    VK->>Core: redeem code
    alt code valid & fresh & VK account unknown
        Core->>Core: accounts(vk) → owner's users row
        Core-->>VK: OK
        VK-->>U: "Accounts linked. Reminders now go to both chats."
    else code expired/used
        Core-->>VK: error
        VK-->>U: "Code invalid. Request a new one."
    end
    note over Core: If the VK account already owned its own tasks,<br/>a merge preview + confirmation is shown first.
